      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAVOC ONE (6) scored (18.21) last time out at this track in a Grade 5 and will break from box 6 for the first time. Strike rate this course strong having won two of four tries. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Well placed and will be tough to beat. TIGGY YANA (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (18.41) at this track behind HAVOC ONE in a Grade 5. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Expected to feature again. JUMPING GEM (8) was safely held in tougher company last start at this track, but prior to that won by a neck at this track (18.85) beating Chattahooche in a Grade 5 on August 11. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Cannot be left out. TIGGERLONG SNAKE (2) must be included on latest effort.",
